    "Tired already? You can start tonight's building now – the night without your phone will just be longer. Your alarm stays at %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tired already? You can start tonight's building now – the night without your phone will just be longer. Your alarm stays at %@."
          }
        },
        "sk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Už sa ti chce spať? Dnešnú stavbu môžeš začať už teraz – noc bez telefónu bude len dlhšia. Budík zazvoní o %@ ako vždy."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drops tapping on the tent, now and then a big drip from a tree.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Drops tapping on the tent, now and then a big drip from a tree."
          }
        },
        "sk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ťukanie kvapiek na plachtu stanu, občas väčšia kvapka zo stromu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "During a Focus (Sleep, Do Not Disturb) the “SleepHole must stay open” warning and the backup alarm could stay silent. Switch them on for SleepHole in the notification settings 🌙": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "During a Focus (Sleep, Do Not Disturb) the “SleepHole must stay open” warning and the backup alarm could stay silent. Switch them on for SleepHole in the notification settings 🌙"
          }
        },
        "sk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Počas Sústredenia (Spánok, Nerušiť) môžu varovanie „SleepHole musí zostať otvorená“ aj záložný budík ostať potichu. Zapni ich pre SleepHole v nastaveniach upozornení 🌙"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each Focus also has its own switch for time sensitive notifications – SleepHole can't see that one.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
