    "Jokers keep your 🔥 streak while you are ill or away: the streak waits – it neither breaks nor grows. Each kind can be used once a month: the bronze one is free, the silver and the gold one cost coins. Protected nights build nothing and pay no coins; a good night still counts as usual.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Jokers keep your 🔥 streak while you are ill or away: the streak waits – it neither breaks nor grows. Each kind can be used once a month: the bronze one is free, the silver and the gold one cost coins. Protected nights build nothing and pay no coins; a good night still counts as usual."
          }
        },
        "sk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Žolíky ochránia tvoju 🔥 sériu počas choroby alebo keď nie si doma: séria počká – nepreruší sa ani nenarastie. Každý druh môžeš použiť raz za mesiac: bronzový je zadarmo, strieborný a zlatý stoja mince. Chránené noci nič nestavajú a neplatia mince; dobrá noc sa aj tak počíta ako zvyčajne."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open SleepHole": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open SleepHole"
          }
        },
        "sk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Otvoriť SleepHole"
          }
        }
      }
    },
