            "value": "Knižnica je dnes plná – všetci si čítajú rozprávky na dobrú noc."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The museum has a new painting: a cat sleeping on a cloud. I wonder who posed for it 🐾": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The museum has a new painting: a cat sleeping on a cloud. I wonder who posed for it 🐾"
